# ART-ALL02 -- W3-FIX-A art acceptance. ALL02 (SNOW night, Colorado): the houses, barns and the objective chapel (CACOLO01) draw their SNOW art (snow roofs), not the temperate twins (was campaign_runtime.inc:217 hard-coding TEMPERATE).
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL02S.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
cheat view_building CACOLO01
wait 2
shot chapel
cheat view_building CAHSE01
wait 2
shot houses
cheat view_building CAHSE03
wait 2
shot houses2
